        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why climb the 5125m of this mountain? Why set out at dawn, risking everything to reach the summit?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this climbing game where precision and mastery are essential, using your two independent grappling hooks. Start in the valley and lower slopes, traverse the ruins of an abandoned castle, brave powerful storms, venture into an ice cave illuminated by magical crystals, and push yourself to reach the top. <br>As you ascend, memories will punctuate your journey, slowly revealing the secrets behind your climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847120/extras/f4d3d595ec4d62466806fb897ae1e5ad.avif?t=1760112246\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique gameplay mechanic: control each grappling hook independently with your mouse, using the left and right mouse buttons to aim and swing from point to point. Chain together precise jumps, avoid deadly falls, and use your agility to overcome every obstacle. The atmosphere is contemplative—there are no enemies, just you versus nature. The challenge rises as you progress, but learning is gradual and fair. And as you reach new heights, you can never fall all the way back down. New mechanics regularly enrich the gameplay, making the experience dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a pixel-art world, immerse yourself in an intense, contemplative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Will you uncover the mysteries haunting your hero?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847120/extras/9c0eb924d0900ccc1591002e25805226.avif?t=1760112246\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why climb the 5125m of this mountain? Why set out at dawn, risking everything to reach the summit?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this climbing game where precision and mastery are essential, using your two independent grappling hooks. Start in the valley and lower slopes, traverse the ruins of an abandoned castle, brave powerful storms, venture into an ice cave illuminated by magical crystals, and push yourself to reach the top. <br>As you ascend, memories will punctuate your journey, slowly revealing the secrets behind your climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847120/extras/f4d3d595ec4d62466806fb897ae1e5ad.avif?t=1760112246\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique gameplay mechanic: control each grappling hook independently with your mouse, using the left and right mouse buttons to aim and swing from point to point. Chain together precise jumps, avoid deadly falls, and use your agility to overcome every obstacle. The atmosphere is contemplative—there are no enemies, just you versus nature. The challenge rises as you progress, but learning is gradual and fair. And as you reach new heights, you can never fall all the way back down. New mechanics regularly enrich the gameplay, making the experience dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a pixel-art world, immerse yourself in an intense, contemplative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Will you uncover the mysteries haunting your hero?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847120/extras/9c0eb924d0900ccc1591002e25805226.avif?t=1760112246\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "A contemplative pixel-art platformer where you climb a mountain with two independent grappling hooks, blending precision, mastery, and exploration, while uncovering the mystery behind your ascent. 5125m. Don’t worry, you don’t have to pronounce it. Just climb it.",
